ut unfortunately also  it doesn't seem easy to queue with a  friend which I find kind of  disappointing because there are a lot of  people me included who would like to  play team-based combat with a mate there  is password matching but as it stands  I've heard that you have to fill the  entire room with people all using that  same pass  which only really makes this a feature  if you have a group of friends that want  to play against each other or for a  streamer or a community like ours for  example that wants to organize a Fight  Club based on a set of rules or just  play within the community and that is  pretty cool  if I do another PvP video I might give  you guys a password and we'll all queue  up together under it we could even use  certain rules like whip only or things  like that and speaking of weapons the  two new weapons I tested were the Onyx  great sword and this Valor Hart paired  weapon so the Onyx great sword is very  standard l2 and wreathes it in flame and  the moveset is nothing new but valor  Hart this Gladius and this small shield  this is fantastic it's actually a paired  weapon which a few clever detectives and  the last video had already kind of  puzzled out and it hasn't also moveset  the most notable thing is this running  art to attack in my opinion because it  does this awesome lunge stab that  actually I believe activates the shield  during the jump so you can't get hit  during it properly and there's this  weapon art shield bash attack which is  fantastic at breaking guards it's a  great all-rounder weapon and there where  are the weapons I could test I believe  there's a javelin that you might see  another PvP footage so I'll put some  other PvP streamers and youtubers in the  description so you can check out their  videos if they make one and unless I'm  missing something in my footage poise  wasn't fixed but it's going to be check  out the description for the patch notes  that are dropping soon flashes of Ariane  del because in the p